        {
          "text": "Eno n'embaluwa Tattenai eyafuganga ekiketezo ekiri ere ng'osomoike omwiga Eufurate, ni Shetharibozenai, ni bakagwa baibwe abandi bwe baafuganga ekiketezo ekiri ere ng'osomoike omwiga Eufurate, ye baagheereza kyabazinga Dario:",
